UN/CEFACT Recommendation 21 (and Recommendation 20)
  Package-type codes in ontology/packaging.yaml are Rec 21 codes. Rec 20 covers units of
  measure; the container nouns (BX, PK, CT, BG, RL, RO, CS, TU) carry status X in Rec 20 with
  the instruction "Use UN/ECE Recommendation 21". Both recommendations are published by UNECE
  and are freely available.

